{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33302","headline":"沙场夜 · 于濆","name":"沙场夜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城上更声发，城下杵声歇。\n征人烧断蓬，对泣沙中月。\n耕牛朝挽甲，战马夜衔铁。\n士卒浣戎衣，交河水爲血。\n轻裘两都客，洞房愁宿别。\n何况远辞家，生死犹未决。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于濆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33302.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33302","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}